  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vijay Sharma S/O Pokhermal Sharma B/C ... vs State Of Rajasthan on 15 December, 2018 Author: Sabina Bench: Sabina High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan Bench At Jaipur S.B. Criminal Miscellaneous Bail No. 15948/2018 Vijay Sharma S/o Pokhermal Sharma B/c Haryana Brahman, R/o Madhvo Ka Mohalla, Village Bansa Kushalpura P.s. Samod, Distt. Jaipur Raj. ----Petitioner Versus State Of Rajasthan, Through P.P. ----Respondent For Petitioner(s) : Mr. Rajeev Surana Adv. For Respondent(s) : Mr. R.R. Gurjar, P.P. Hon'Ble Mrs. Justice Sabina Judgment 14/12/2018",
    "facts": "Petitioner has filed this petition under Section 438 Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 seeking anticipatory bail in FIR No.607/2016 registered at Police Station Chomu, District Jaipur for offence under Sections 420, 269, 272, 273 and 120-B of Indian Penal Code, 1860 and Section 63, 63A, 64 of The Copyright Act, 1957 and Section 7/16 of Food and Safety and Standard Act, 1954. Investigation qua the petitioner was kept pending. Petitioner is ready to join (2 of 2) [CRLMB-15948/2018] investigation. Learned State counsel has opposed the petition.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that the petitioner has been falsely involved in this case being a brother of co-accused Kailash Sharma. Petitioner is not named in the FIR nor is running the premises-in-question.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that the petitioner has been falsely involved in this case being a brother of co-accused Kailash Sharma. Petitioner is not named in the FIR nor is running the premises-in-question.",
